package feed:
https://lists.yoctoproject.org/g/yocto/topic/88553371#55926

In my case the issue was that bitbake no longer resolves recursive =
dependencies of the do_build task:
=
https://git.yoctoproject.org/poky/commit/?id=3D568f62214bca3ac6d35eef8d9f4=
562596fb4c9ab

This means if you use a command like =E2=80=9Cbitbake =
packagegroup-foo=E2=80=9D to build your package feed, you won=E2=80=99t =
get all of the packages built. I just had to change how my package feed =
was generated by using "bitbake --runall build packagegroup-foo=E2=80=9D =
to build my package feed from my packagegroup recipe.

I=E2=80=99m not sure if you=E2=80=99re seeing the same issue, but the =
symptoms are the same as what I saw.

